# Keep the Docker build context lean and secret-free (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md Decision #57).
# Env files are NEVER shipped into an image; the build needs none (Decision #43).

# Dependencies / build outputs (rebuilt inside the builder stage)
node_modules
.next
out
dist
build
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Env — never send secrets into the build context (.env.example included: the image has no use for it)
.env
.env.*

# VCS / CI / IaC / docs / tests — not needed to build or run the app
.git
.gitignore
.github
infra
docs/screenshots
docs
coverage
*.md

# Docker (not needed inside the image)
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
.dockerignore

# Editor / OS / misc
.claude
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
